WEBVTT

01:48.983 --> 01:50.610
You haven't changed.

01:52.403 --> 01:53.404
Neither have you.

01:54.447 --> 01:55.990
No, I've changed.

01:56.533 --> 01:59.160
You can see that, can't you?

01:59.828 --> 02:00.870
I got old,

02:01.871 --> 02:03.081
and so have you.

02:04.040 --> 02:06.543
And yet, you look just as I remember.

02:08.044 --> 02:12.298
Must be bad if you're
reachin' out like this.

02:13.007 --> 02:16.177
Yeah... You could say that.

02:16.261 --> 02:17.345
Tell me.

02:18.304 --> 02:20.306
It’s about my daughter.

02:21.432 --> 02:24.978
Been keepin' company
with some shady types lately.

02:25.061 --> 02:27.272
Calls themselves Maelstrom.

02:27.355 --> 02:29.941
You're kiddin'. Them?

02:30.024 --> 02:34.571
That's not all. She's been
installin' cyberware on her own...

02:35.905 --> 02:37.532
Chrome-junkie cult nonsense.

02:37.615 --> 02:40.493
Tried to stop her,
but she won't listen! If I push hard...

02:41.536 --> 02:43.288
she runs off to them.

02:43.371 --> 02:47.584
Lately, her moods have been unstable,
and she's been actin' strange.

02:47.667 --> 02:51.588
I think it's the early signs
of cyberpsychosis.

02:51.671 --> 02:53.381
- Hmm...
- I'm sure of it!

02:55.633 --> 02:57.552
Last time, it was her entire jaw!

02:57.635 --> 03:00.430
If we don’t stop her now,
it’ll be too late...

03:06.728 --> 03:09.230
Whoa, hold on!
That's what you wanna pitch me?!

03:09.314 --> 03:10.648
No!

03:11.649 --> 03:14.402
You've got experience dealin' with gangs.

03:14.485 --> 03:17.155
She's not a gangster, she's your daughter!

03:17.238 --> 03:18.239
Besides...

03:19.157 --> 03:21.159
I'm not good at lecturin' kids...

03:21.242 --> 03:23.202
It's not just about her.

03:24.329 --> 03:26.164
Maelstrom's involved!

03:26.247 --> 03:28.249
'Course, you'll get paid.

03:28.333 --> 03:30.209
That's not the issue here.

03:30.293 --> 03:34.172
It is. That’s why I came to you as a pro,
not as someone askin' for a favor.

03:34.255 --> 03:36.633
How about 50k? Paid upfront.

03:36.716 --> 03:37.926
Come on...

03:38.885 --> 03:40.428
Not enough?

03:40.511 --> 03:42.680
Thought that was more
than the standard rate.

03:42.764 --> 03:43.973
It is.

03:44.682 --> 03:46.684
- It's more than enough.
- Then...

03:47.310 --> 03:49.354
No, I can't take this job.

03:50.897 --> 03:52.398
Not the way I am...

03:54.400 --> 03:55.693
I knew it.

03:57.612 --> 03:58.821
What?

03:58.905 --> 04:00.073
Look at the photo.

04:01.908 --> 04:03.076
Talia.

04:03.660 --> 04:05.578
She's our daughter.

04:06.913 --> 04:09.123
My... daughter?

05:05.680 --> 05:08.975
Now I see why
I found you caught yesterday.

05:10.101 --> 05:14.272
You after Maelstrom footage?
Into more hardcore stuff than I expected.

05:14.355 --> 05:17.150
It's not like I wanna! It's a job...

05:17.650 --> 05:19.360
A job, huh...

05:21.863 --> 05:23.197
Then we're the same.

05:24.032 --> 05:25.033
The same?

05:25.116 --> 05:26.284
Lend me a hand.

05:27.201 --> 05:29.704
You wanna film it, right? The vid.

05:33.458 --> 05:35.418
By the way, haven't told me your name.

05:36.419 --> 05:38.129
Meant to ask before.

05:39.756 --> 05:41.966
My name's Roman. You?

05:42.675 --> 05:43.676
What's it matter?

05:43.760 --> 05:45.636
Be easier to talk, won't it?

05:47.722 --> 05:48.723
D.

05:49.432 --> 05:51.225
D? That's all I get?

05:51.309 --> 05:52.727
That's all you get.

05:53.311 --> 05:54.353
Here we are.

06:37.939 --> 06:39.398
Helio! Heli--!

06:42.235 --> 06:43.611
Who the fuck...?!

06:47.865 --> 06:49.117
- A kid...
- Heads up!

06:58.918 --> 07:00.837
Ow! Ow!

07:05.383 --> 07:08.302
Fuck! Fuckin' runner...

07:19.605 --> 07:22.233
Hey. You Helio?

07:22.316 --> 07:24.026
- Who... the fuck...
- Helio, right?!

07:24.110 --> 07:26.446
Stop! Yes! I'm Helio!

07:26.529 --> 07:28.030
I have questions.

07:28.114 --> 07:30.450
If this is about the chip,
then you're wastin' your ti--

07:31.742 --> 07:34.662
Whatever you wanna know,
I'll spill. Anything...

07:34.745 --> 07:36.330
Start makin' sense.

07:36.414 --> 07:38.791
Ain't you after that Arasaka datashard?

07:39.459 --> 07:41.419
You hit a Snake Nation camp.

07:42.879 --> 07:44.338
"Wait!"

07:44.964 --> 07:47.258
He's tryna say "wait"...

07:50.970 --> 07:53.347
Seriously? Was so long ago...

07:53.431 --> 07:54.557
"So long ago?"

07:58.144 --> 07:59.937
Nothin' "so long ago" about it.

08:00.021 --> 08:01.647
Been chasin' this the whole damn time...

08:01.731 --> 08:03.065
Shit... I get it...

08:03.149 --> 08:05.359
If you get it, then start fuckin' talkin'!

08:09.655 --> 08:13.326
Didn't do it. Didn't take the job.

08:13.409 --> 08:16.120
Never went to the nomad camp.

08:18.956 --> 08:19.957
Is that the truth?

08:20.041 --> 08:22.752
It's the truth. You've gotta believe me.

08:23.836 --> 08:26.797
Why... Why'd you decide not to go?

08:28.257 --> 08:31.469
It wasn’t supposed to be a raid.

08:31.552 --> 08:34.472
Gig was simple. Find someone.

08:34.555 --> 08:36.724
Pay too good to be true.

08:36.807 --> 08:40.228
Everyone else jumped on the cash.

08:40.311 --> 08:42.563
But somethin' wasn't addin' up,
so I backed out.

08:43.314 --> 08:46.859
Then shit went sideways at the scene.
Ended in a shoot-out...

08:46.943 --> 08:49.362
- So someone hired you?
- Yeah.

08:50.321 --> 08:51.322
Who?

08:51.405 --> 08:52.865
I don't know.

08:52.949 --> 08:55.076
Client kept it anonymous.

08:55.159 --> 08:57.578
In hindsight, it must've been a corpo.

08:57.662 --> 08:58.663
Which corp?

08:58.746 --> 09:00.623
Arasaka if I really had to guess.

09:00.706 --> 09:02.375
What would 'Saka want with us?

09:02.458 --> 09:03.876
Hell if I know.

09:03.960 --> 09:07.338
Just guessin' off the gig route
and how they ran the op.

09:07.421 --> 09:09.423
Good that I passed on it.

09:09.507 --> 09:12.510
Of all corps,
Arasaka’s the one I can’t stand.

09:12.593 --> 09:16.138
Earlier, you mentioned
somethin' about an Arasaka chip.

09:16.222 --> 09:17.390
Is that related?

09:17.473 --> 09:19.934
Nah, different shit entirely...

09:20.017 --> 09:22.812
Anyone involved in that
is disappearin' one by one.

09:22.895 --> 09:23.896
Disappearing?

09:23.980 --> 09:26.232
Probably dead somewhere.

09:26.315 --> 09:29.735
Even on the decline, getting
mixed up with 'Saka never ends well.

09:29.819 --> 09:32.029
That whole corp's fuckin' cursed.

09:34.031 --> 09:36.826
You a survivor from the camp?

09:37.493 --> 09:40.913
And you've been doin' this ever since?

09:41.664 --> 09:42.665
All this time?

10:05.938 --> 10:09.567
- D, did you just kill--
- He's not dead.

10:10.276 --> 10:11.444
I'm no killer.

10:12.612 --> 10:14.280
He didn't do it.

10:21.037 --> 10:24.707
Can I... go home?

10:24.790 --> 10:25.916
What?

10:38.429 --> 10:44.310
This new implant is syncing well
with your daughter so far.

10:44.894 --> 10:47.938
Frankly, removing it
may do more harm than good.

10:48.022 --> 10:50.441
But is it really safe?

10:50.524 --> 10:54.904
She’s already chromed up head to toe.
I’m worried she’s going to lose her mind...

10:54.987 --> 10:57.323
You mean, in terms of cyberpsychosis?

10:57.406 --> 10:58.407
Yes.

10:58.491 --> 11:03.579
Given her amount of implants, it wouldn’t
be a surprise if symptoms started showing.

11:03.663 --> 11:06.916
But so far, we haven't seen any signs.

11:06.999 --> 11:10.628
This is an exceptionally rare case...
but she remains stable.

11:11.462 --> 11:13.089
I see no need for concern.

11:14.507 --> 11:16.717
Now, about her treatment plan...

11:18.469 --> 11:20.846
I'll have to return to the office.

11:21.639 --> 11:22.640
I know.

11:23.140 --> 11:26.185
She's going to be fine. Trust the doctor.

11:26.268 --> 11:28.979
But if she gets any more implants...

11:29.063 --> 11:32.691
I understand.
That's why we brought her in.

11:32.775 --> 11:35.069
- She'll be fine for now...
- For now?!

11:35.152 --> 11:37.238
We gotta cut her off for good!

11:37.321 --> 11:38.406
How, exactly?

11:39.115 --> 11:44.036
You understand what makes her
want to rely on implants, don't you?

11:44.995 --> 11:46.831
You think this is my fault...

11:46.914 --> 11:47.998
Not at all.

11:48.833 --> 11:51.377
If there's any blame to bear,
then it falls to us both.

11:52.086 --> 11:54.088
But this isn't anyone's fault.

11:54.171 --> 11:56.298
Not yours, not Talia's.

11:57.842 --> 12:02.888
Think carefully.
Let's decide what the best option is.

12:03.889 --> 12:05.516
You're right. I'm sorry.

12:05.599 --> 12:06.600
Don’t be.

12:07.143 --> 12:09.603
I had hoped to see Talia,
but I should get going.

12:10.354 --> 12:12.356
Work won’t stop calling me.

12:13.399 --> 12:14.400
I'm here.

12:15.401 --> 12:16.777
Yeah... Nothing's wrong...

12:16.861 --> 12:18.070
It's a separate matter.

12:18.821 --> 12:20.281
About that...

12:22.575 --> 12:25.536
Avida, what's the matter?
Where's your husband?

12:25.619 --> 12:27.079
He left.

12:27.580 --> 12:29.039
Did somethin' happen?

12:29.790 --> 12:31.167
Nothin'...

12:32.334 --> 12:33.794
I wonder if Talia's awake.

12:37.214 --> 12:40.634
Might still be asleep, but...
maybe you could at least see her.

12:41.969 --> 12:44.555
Talia! What are you doing?!

12:44.638 --> 12:47.641
Where are your clothes?!
Look what you've done to your gown...

12:47.725 --> 12:51.520
Talia! Why do you always...

12:51.604 --> 12:52.605
Who's he?

12:55.191 --> 12:58.110
What, first time seein' chrome like this?

12:58.611 --> 12:59.612
No, just...

13:00.237 --> 13:01.697
Uh-huh.

13:03.991 --> 13:06.660
Was you who called 'em in.
Wasn't it, Mom?

13:06.744 --> 13:08.287
Them?

13:08.370 --> 13:10.122
Kang Tao's troops.

13:10.998 --> 13:12.124
Unbelievable.

13:12.208 --> 13:14.460
That was because you...

13:15.127 --> 13:17.546
- What'd the doc say?
- What?

13:17.630 --> 13:19.465
Am I goin' cyberpsycho?

13:19.548 --> 13:22.009
He said you're stable for now.

13:23.219 --> 13:24.386
Then I'm outta here.

13:24.470 --> 13:26.889
Already? I'll go with you...

13:27.681 --> 13:29.141
I'm not going home.

13:29.225 --> 13:30.309
Avida!

13:31.977 --> 13:33.646
- Ouch...
- Shit!

13:37.775 --> 13:38.901
See ya.

13:40.194 --> 13:41.237
Talia!

13:51.163 --> 13:52.373
Talia!

13:55.626 --> 13:57.545
Avida, you stay here.

14:06.929 --> 14:08.097
Hey.

14:09.056 --> 14:12.059
Sorry, but I know this area well.

14:12.142 --> 14:13.143
Who're you again?

14:13.727 --> 14:16.480
I'm an... old friend of your mom's.

14:16.564 --> 14:17.856
So you're nobody.

14:18.482 --> 14:20.276
Can we talk for a bit?

14:23.070 --> 14:24.238
Wait.

14:26.323 --> 14:28.617
I'll tell you how to disable the GPS.

14:29.201 --> 14:31.996
Take it that's what
you were searchin' for earlier?

14:32.872 --> 14:34.999
So they can't track down your whereabouts...

14:35.499 --> 14:37.376
- Am I right?
- You can do that?

14:38.127 --> 14:40.963
Kang Tao would've chipped it
along the inner thigh.

14:41.797 --> 14:44.049
If I disable it, will you hear me out?

14:45.467 --> 14:47.428
Touch me, I flatline you.

14:47.511 --> 14:49.555
No problem. Won't have to.

14:53.726 --> 14:55.394
You're an edgerunner?

14:56.145 --> 14:57.146
Suppose so.

14:58.147 --> 14:59.940
Okay. All done.

15:00.983 --> 15:04.403
Overwrote the ID.
They can't track you anymore.

15:06.196 --> 15:08.782
So, about what I wanted to say...

15:12.661 --> 15:14.580
We're about the same.

15:15.456 --> 15:16.582
What do you mean?

15:16.665 --> 15:17.833
Our height.

15:23.589 --> 15:25.591
Fuck! Talia!

15:51.450 --> 15:53.035
I miss my camera...

15:53.577 --> 15:55.204
- What's that?
- Huh?

15:55.287 --> 15:56.747
That’s a camera, isn’t it?

15:56.830 --> 15:58.165
This is my backup camera.

15:58.248 --> 15:59.792
What's the difference?

15:59.875 --> 16:02.962
Oh, you wanna hear about it?
You interested?

16:03.045 --> 16:04.046
No.

16:05.714 --> 16:07.800
Think it's time to call it quits?

16:07.883 --> 16:09.510
Easy for you to say.

16:09.593 --> 16:11.679
You're all outta leads, aren't you?

16:11.762 --> 16:13.389
That's why I'm thinking.

16:13.472 --> 16:15.599
Then let me know
when you come up with somethin'.

16:15.683 --> 16:17.101
You think too!

16:17.184 --> 16:18.352
Me?

16:18.435 --> 16:21.188
Damn right. Ass stays here
till you come up with an idea.

16:23.023 --> 16:26.110
How about we hack into Arasaka
and snoop around for info?

16:26.193 --> 16:28.779
Are you stupid?
Even washed-up, they're still a corp.

16:28.862 --> 16:32.992
Not directly... but what about
a smaller corp they work with?

16:33.075 --> 16:35.369
We could access 'Saka through them.

16:39.248 --> 16:42.626
Shit. The hell is this? Ugh, no good.

16:43.293 --> 16:45.212
There’s no link to begin with!

16:45.295 --> 16:46.922
What's our move now?

16:47.006 --> 16:48.882
- Huh? Me?
- Was your idea.

16:48.966 --> 16:50.759
So it's my fault?

16:54.096 --> 16:58.976
Hey, 'bout what Helio said...
Mentioned some kind of Arasaka chip.

16:59.059 --> 17:00.769
Did you get any info on that?

17:00.853 --> 17:05.107
Sure. Pulled somethin',
just in case... This it?

17:05.190 --> 17:08.444
If you get that chip,
Arasaka might wanna negotiate.

17:09.903 --> 17:11.113
You think so?

17:11.196 --> 17:14.616
I dunno... But what other
options do you have?

17:15.409 --> 17:16.410
None.

17:16.493 --> 17:19.830
Then what've you got to lose?
I say we try it.

17:21.331 --> 17:22.791
Data says it’s around here?

17:25.210 --> 17:26.253
That building?

17:26.962 --> 17:28.047
Yeah.

17:28.130 --> 17:29.131
What's up?

17:29.214 --> 17:32.426
That building not givin' you
the heebie-jeebies?

17:32.509 --> 17:33.635
Heebie-jeebies...?

17:34.762 --> 17:36.513
I can't really tell.

17:37.723 --> 17:38.974
Whatever.

17:47.649 --> 17:48.650
D!

17:48.734 --> 17:51.153
Any luck over there?

17:53.947 --> 17:55.282
D!

17:55.365 --> 17:58.285
I’m not seeing any doors that’ll open.

17:59.787 --> 18:02.498
D? What's the matter?

18:02.581 --> 18:05.334
- Surveillance cams everywhere.
- Where?

18:05.417 --> 18:09.004
Don't waste your time lookin' for 'em.
They're concealed well.

18:09.088 --> 18:10.297
Seriously?

18:11.590 --> 18:13.842
Every other door’s a bust.

18:13.926 --> 18:16.595
This one might open, but...

18:16.678 --> 18:17.846
But?

18:17.930 --> 18:21.225
Counterintrusion on this place
would put most corps to shame.

18:21.308 --> 18:23.811
Except this door... where they left a gap.

18:23.894 --> 18:25.938
Maybe they made it
easier to get in and out?

18:26.021 --> 18:27.397
Normally, it's the other way around.

18:27.481 --> 18:30.234
Which means this is probably a trap.

18:30.317 --> 18:31.652
A trap?

18:34.029 --> 18:35.030
What do we do?

18:35.739 --> 18:36.740
We go in.

18:36.824 --> 18:39.159
What? But it's a trap!

18:39.243 --> 18:41.662
They're daring me to bite.

18:41.745 --> 18:44.164
Fuck it. I'll bite.

18:48.669 --> 18:50.129
- Careful...
- Just watch.

19:10.774 --> 19:12.651
Didn't do it.

19:31.670 --> 19:33.130
Oh, you're awake.

19:35.132 --> 19:36.133
Where am I?

19:36.216 --> 19:37.342
My place.

19:37.426 --> 19:40.804
You passed out, so I had to deal with it.
Couldn’t just leave you there.

19:40.888 --> 19:42.055
- The cab--
- Where is she!?

19:42.139 --> 19:44.141
What do you mean? "She", who?

19:44.641 --> 19:46.810
- You're payin' for that cab--
- Dammit!

19:46.894 --> 19:48.353
That bitch...

19:53.275 --> 19:54.484
Got up too fast.

19:54.568 --> 19:56.695
Dropped me in a second.

19:56.778 --> 19:58.739
Don’t even know how it happened.

20:02.826 --> 20:03.952
What are you gonna do?

20:04.536 --> 20:07.164
Revenge...

20:07.915 --> 20:09.166
You can't even stand.

20:11.835 --> 20:13.253
Morning already?

20:13.337 --> 20:15.005
- It's almost night.
- What?!

20:15.088 --> 20:16.965
- You slept half the day.
- The fuck?!

20:17.049 --> 20:19.218
Roman! Did your friend wake up?

20:19.301 --> 20:20.302
Yeah, Dad!

20:20.385 --> 20:22.679
- Can you run an errand for me?
- Okay.

20:22.763 --> 20:26.183
I’ll goin' out, D.
You can get revenge tomorrow.

20:26.266 --> 20:29.436
Oh, and don't forget
to pay me back for the cab!

20:42.282 --> 20:46.078
Hey! Uh, what was it... 'Ganic boy!

20:46.161 --> 20:47.663
No, wait, who are you?

20:49.539 --> 20:51.833
Hey! Remember me?

20:51.917 --> 20:53.210
Huh?

20:54.294 --> 20:56.338
- Huh?!
- No?

20:56.421 --> 20:59.007
- Well, about your recording...
- I'm kinda busy shopping...

20:59.091 --> 21:01.343
- Sorry!
- Why the big rush?

21:01.426 --> 21:03.637
Um, I'm shopping...

21:03.720 --> 21:04.888
You look done to me.

21:05.764 --> 21:06.890
I'm sorry.

21:06.974 --> 21:09.017
What's with the apology?

21:09.101 --> 21:11.186
You're not mad at me?

21:11.270 --> 21:12.980
You're sure working me up to it.

21:13.855 --> 21:15.565
Kidding. Here ya go.

21:15.649 --> 21:17.859
- My camera...
- Returning it.

21:17.943 --> 21:20.112
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

21:20.195 --> 21:22.698
Hey, it was a great reel.

21:22.781 --> 21:23.782
Huh?

21:23.865 --> 21:26.868
The vid of me! Watched it a few times.

21:27.536 --> 21:29.746
Well, this is a good camera.

21:32.708 --> 21:34.293
Uh... W-What--

21:34.376 --> 21:37.879
Good camera or not,
an ordinary person couldn't scroll that.

21:38.547 --> 21:40.299
Y-You think so?

21:40.382 --> 21:41.383
You've got talent.

21:43.218 --> 21:44.886
Um... well...

21:44.970 --> 21:47.639
Thanks, I guess.

21:48.223 --> 21:49.683
Say, scroll me again?

21:50.309 --> 21:51.643
What?

21:51.727 --> 21:52.894
You won't?

21:52.978 --> 21:56.606
- S-sure.
- Great!

21:56.690 --> 21:57.733
It's a promise!

21:57.816 --> 21:59.568
Oh, can I get your contact info?

21:59.651 --> 22:01.153
Yeah, sure.

22:01.778 --> 22:04.281
Let's see... Roman?

22:05.115 --> 22:06.283
I'm Talia.

22:06.366 --> 22:08.201
- Nice to meet ya.
- You too...

22:08.285 --> 22:10.787
So come by tomorrow and scroll my surgery.

22:11.997 --> 22:13.165
Surgery?

22:15.208 --> 22:16.543
Sorry, gotta go.

22:16.626 --> 22:18.545
- I'll buzz ya later.
- Hey, wait...

22:18.628 --> 22:20.464
Bye now! Lookin' forward to tomorrow!

22:20.547 --> 22:21.923
Hey! Tomorrow?!

22:25.010 --> 22:26.511
Whoa... So cool.

22:29.765 --> 22:31.141
Agh... dead battery...

23:07.886 --> 23:09.262
Whatcha doin'?

23:09.346 --> 23:11.890
Upping my ICE, just in case.

23:12.474 --> 23:13.850
Still goin' today?

23:13.934 --> 23:16.019
Yup. Gonna wrap this up, then we go.

23:16.103 --> 23:17.896
Uh, about me...

23:17.979 --> 23:18.980
You're coming.

23:19.523 --> 23:20.857
Right...

23:45.465 --> 23:47.968
Talia, ready to get started?

23:48.468 --> 23:49.594
'Kay.

24:03.441 --> 24:05.694
Hey! Back off!

24:05.777 --> 24:07.362
What's goin' on?

24:07.445 --> 24:09.364
Found this guy creepin' outside.

24:10.448 --> 24:11.491
Dammit!

24:14.953 --> 24:16.371
Who is he?

24:16.454 --> 24:17.914
Fuck if I know.

25:49.923 --> 25:54.928
